Package: logitfit
Title: Logistic Regression by Iteratively Reweighted Least Squares
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Aayush", "Sheth", email = "acsheth@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Aayush Sheth
Maintainer: Aayush Sheth <acsheth@umich.edu>
Description: Fits binomial logistic regression with the logit link by Fisher
    scoring, also called iteratively reweighted least squares. The scoring
    update is implemented directly in R and in C++ through Rcpp, and the
    package returns coefficients, Wald inference, fitted probabilities, and
    predictions that can be checked against stats::glm.
